      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1991941081525522562",
      "text": "[7:42PM] #LagosBadagryExp #TrafficUpdate \n\nFrom Customs check point, Jida bus stop, Estate gate down to Morogbo is very busy at the moment, return journey inward Ijanikin is very busy as well. \n\nBusy contraflow movement from Morogbo down to Odofa. \n\nMovement is good from Odofa, Exodus car wash, Church gate, Magbon, through Okoafo, Mowo, Aradagun, Limca bus stop down to Badagry roundabout. \n\nGood movement in and out Seme/Gbaji, Badagry town and Ajara respectively. \n\nReturn journey to Odofa from Badagry round is good to go.",
